E
obsidian tablet~
We are the last now, we invoked her wrath,
and we are no more.
The city is dead, the healthy, the honored,
they have fled across the ocean.
We, the not yet dead,
the not yet living,
we remain, hoping her womb,
hoping it would shelter us.
No.  It will not.
Her wrath is broken,
we cannot be saved.
~
